<title>USA: Equity completes buys from Service Corp.</title>
<headline>Equity completes buys from Service Corp.</headline>
<dateline>LUFKIN, Texas 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Equity Corp International said on Wednesday that it has completed the acquisition of 11 funeral homes from Service Corp International for $10,625,000 in cash.</p>
<p>The properties are in Maine, West Virginia, Iowa and Texas, the company said.</p>
<p>Equity Corp International said it owns and operates 163 funeral homes and 62 cemeteries in 23 states.</p>
